                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9ef9c35b-f950-38df-bc2f-020dc129e93c",
                        "entry_id": "1a4c99e2-fc60-326b-9324-a81f76032d41",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. квитанция, талон, дающий право на бесплатное посещение театра, кино и т. п."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "62100d7e-970e-4ddb-bee8-e8e3c2abe9fa",
                                "sense_id": "9ef9c35b-f950-38df-bc2f-020dc129e93c",
                                "text": "Здесь они встречались с антрепренёрами, с товарищами по сцене, могли получить контрамарку в театр и повидать воочию своих драматургов…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01376321-3646-4d0c-a6ce-b70758223854",
                                "sense_id": "9ef9c35b-f950-38df-bc2f-020dc129e93c",
                                "text": "Однажды счастливой девушке подарили контрамарку в кино."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cf9c6fbd-ed32-3196-a962-7de5cac3efb3",
                        "entry_id": "1a4c99e2-fc60-326b-9324-a81f76032d41",
                        "glosses": [
                            "нумизм. знак, который делался на монетах после их фабрикации для того, чтобы им придать или другое достоинство или другое назначение"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b3a1ced0-3852-4391-b9b0-2dc195e08d2c",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a4c99e2-fc60-326b-9324-a81f76032d41",
                        "source_sense_description": "квитанция, талон",
                        "target_lang_word": "free pass",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "free pass",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3965b238-d1ed-3344-8c46-292a343990cc",
                                        "entry_id": "f87f46fd-cdc8-3496-a2a8-c5295a0566fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A document entitling the bearer to free transportation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6521812a-bac6-4e5d-bc8c-713d32aab94e",
                                                "sense_id": "3965b238-d1ed-3344-8c46-292a343990cc",
                                                "text": "As a railwayman put it to me: \"When I saw chums of mine took their families down there by car, I could see the writing on the wall. We all had free passes, yet they got the car out!\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "864d3be9-0f98-31cf-8275-7b2e87d7efd5",
                                        "entry_id": "f87f46fd-cdc8-3496-a2a8-c5295a0566fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An exemption from normal processes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e47276e-16d5-42e5-b55c-0f531fe4106c",
                                                "sense_id": "864d3be9-0f98-31cf-8275-7b2e87d7efd5",
                                                "text": "At the same time, however, no one is entitled to a free pass to the nation's highest court."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a2c2f80-aefe-4835-94ea-a70a22d14841",
                                                "sense_id": "864d3be9-0f98-31cf-8275-7b2e87d7efd5",
                                                "text": "“A tiny elite appear to have a free pass to pollute,” said Nafkote Dabi, climate policy lead at Oxfam, which commissioned the study by the Institute for European Environmental Policy (IEEP) and the Stockholm Environment Institute (SEI)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9df79bf0-c536-34b4-8179-8150ec3e8abd",
                                        "entry_id": "f87f46fd-cdc8-3496-a2a8-c5295a0566fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An intentional walk."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8eee29e1-7a52-4822-b402-ebed18a807cb",
                                                "sense_id": "9df79bf0-c536-34b4-8179-8150ec3e8abd",
                                                "text": "Smith was issued a free pass after Jones' double."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7c23fc4f-8e35-4035-8f59-e0f51eb37f7a",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a4c99e2-fc60-326b-9324-a81f76032d41",
